sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor O as Console Operator
    actor P as Player Client
    participant API as Control Plane<br/>engine-api
    participant DB as SurrealDB
    participant GS as Game Server

    O->>API: POST /v2/console/tournament<br/>window, join_required, rule_key
    API->>DB: leaderboard row (category = 1)

    P->>API: GET /v2/tournament
    API-->>P: tournaments[] + cursor

    P->>API: POST /v2/tournament/{id}/join
    API->>DB: load board + active rule
    API->>DB: load player_stat
    alt rule missing or unmet
        API-->>P: 400 "Player does not meet the tournament rule."
    else eligible
        API->>DB: create leaderboard_record + size++
        API-->>P: 200
    end

    P->>API: POST /v2/tournament/{id}<br/>{ score, subscore, operator }
    API->>DB: require rule again + upsert record
    API-->>P: record + rank

    P->>API: GET /v2/tournament/{id}
    API-->>P: records[] sorted

    opt authoritative board
        GS->>API: result (server key)
        API->>DB: write score
    end
